          "description": "项目侧 `init --dir <p>/docs/prism` 落盘的目录树与 prism 仓 `content/` 同构（同名子目录 `briefings/storyworlds/masters/pipelines/produced/distribution`），且生成门面 `docs/prism/README.md`，README 内含大纲/母稿/分镜剧本三类索引条目"
