          "ac_id": "AC-PDO-002",
          "description": "公开 skill 指令面写明 `PRISM_HOME` 约定：`skills/prism-director/SKILL.md`、`skills/prism-produce/SKILL.md`、`skills/prism-qa/SKILL.md` 三个文件内命令一律写成 `$PRISM_HOME/scripts/...` 形式；项目仓 `git ls-files` 中 `prompt_compiler.py` / `ai_manga_drama.py` / `drama_spec.py` 的命中路径全部位于 `scripts/` 之下（唯一能力 SoT，无副本）"
