          "description": "`contracts/form-manga-drama.contract.md §4` 与 `content/pipelines/ai-manga-drama/README.md` 对 episode 产物路径只保留一条 canonical 表述，另一条显式标注 alias/deprecated；存在 `scripts/check_*` 断言两处 canonical 一致（含反向断言：alias 行存在且 canonical 行唯一）"
        },
        {
          "ac_id": "AC-PDO-004",
          "description": "`scripts/install_public_surfaces.sh` 文件头注释明确写出\"只装指令面\"，并写明能力面经 `PRISM_HOME` 获取；`skills/prism-director/SKILL.md` 含能力定位段（声明 `PRISM_HOME` 与 `scripts/` 关系）；`scripts/check_prism_project_docs.sh --install-notice` 对以上两点 exit 0"
        },
        {
          "ac_id": "AC-PDO-005",
          "description": "`docs/prism/` 产物中不出现需求真相字段（`slug/status/revision_id/parser_contract` frontmatter），`docs/beacon/` 下不出现分镜/成片产物文件；交叉引用仅允许 `docs/prism/**` 引用 beacon feature slug 单向"
